    "gp_section_609146088880341938": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "ccd575f664a9ebfe3c49d21e371826d0513911f6f9ac6068f548acb8c932f338_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg-DQ9ZNtYN_text": "<p>Of participants felt a noticeable boost in daily energy</p>",
        "gg1F4yl3wN-_text": "<p>95%</p>",
        "gg1Xn7AyDBI_text": "<p>Backed by a rigorous 12-week randomized, controlled clinical trial and independently verified by NSF International to meet the highest standards in sport.</p>",
        "gg36LGMvjFY_text": "<p>I've been fortunate to work with some of the world's top medical professionals, nutrition experts, and fitness coaches throughout my life. Their guidance has always been crucial to my health. Since retiring from football, I've focused even more on eating well and staying informed about the latest science in health and supplements.</p>",
        "gg5Vc1ZZ1fV_text": "<p>85%</p>",
        "gg5k8M_QVDO_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:22px;\">😴</span></p>",
        "gg8R73xT9kt_text": "<p>Perform Sharper</p>",
        "gg92w1xvx_a_text": "<p>12-week randomized controlled trial</p>",
        "ggAlj-uSwcn_text": "<p>80%</p>",
        "ggBh08feqBX_text": "<p>Participants reported getting better sleep</p>",
        "ggCgdtZhmjf_text": "<p>Of participants experienced better digestion and less bloating</p>",
        "ggFbcVGHxK2_text": "<p>Aryna Sabalenka</p>",
        "ggKCDAHxg-W_text": "<p>World No. 1 Tennis Player NSF Certifie</p>",
        "ggMmt1rIcR__text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>David Beckham</strong></span></p>",
        "ggQNGwzcE7r_text": "<p>Since taking IM8 daily, I've genuinely felt better — more energy, better focus, and just a stronger sense of overall wellness. And one of the best parts? It tastes amazing — like a refreshing blend of acai and mixed berries. It's something I look forward to drinking every morning.</p>",
        "ggSgLub39n-_text": "<p>🧠</p>",
        "ggSuJlWgJVH_text": "<p>⚡</p>",
        "ggThX2uuYnF_text": "<p>Trust &amp; Certification</p>",
        "ggW-3QqUH5I_text": "<p>75%</p>",
        "ggYJcHJwG43_text": "<p>Clinical Results</p>",
        "gg_sJYVpRsF_text": "Trusted by World-Class Athletes.",
        "gga-uOKI8Zl_childItem_0": "<p>280+ Substances Tested</p>",
        "gga-uOKI8Zl_childItem_1": "<p>Third-Party Verified</p>",
        "ggfO1V29hBX_text": "A Note from David Beckham",
        "ggki5lqavCH_text": "<p>For me, taking care of my health means being present for my family and living fully, every day. IM8 helps me do that — and I am so proud of what we've built.</p>",
        "ggmSRVcvzv7_text": "<p>🦠</p>",
        "ggnUEbxAyBW_text": "<p>NSF Certified for Sport</p>",
        "ggsFZmo7pAp_text": "<p>I've shared IM8 with my friends and family, and everyone's felt the difference — whether it's more energy, better sleep or just feeling like they're finally on top of their health. That's what it's all about.</p>",
        "ggvKF4s2kSu_text": "<p>We've built a world-class scientific advisory board with leaders in medicine, nutrition, and even space science. Every ingredient in IM8 is selected with intention and backed by rigorous research. That's what makes it different — and why I trust it for my own health.</p>",
        "ggvp1JGDbfK_text": "<p>CLINICALLY PROVEN. THIRD-PARTY TESTED.</p>",
        "ggwZdM-rgJT_text": "<p>Supplements have been a part of my daily routine for years, but I've often felt overwhelmed by how many different products it takes to truly support your body. That's why IM8 is so different — it's simplified everything for me.</p>",
        "ggzDiQY0JvY_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:14px;\">Co-Founding Partner</span></p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-609146088880341938"
    },
    "gp_section_609146088880407474": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "be2c4fae9f07b3b0adb55b93d5a526d8e7c0cd4683e585e7cf5b588e4ebe8359_1_1_1_0__1",
        "ggCWchj59Qs_text": "<p>Quarterly Plan</p>",
        "ggHERmAF8zv_text": "<p>Over 700K customers. 4.8/5 average rating. We're confident enough to bet on your experience — because 87% of clinical trial participants felt a noticeable difference.</p>",
        "ggIDgBaCtvv_text": "<p>A full month to feel the energy, the clarity, and the difference. Not convinced? Full refund.</p>",
        "ggJ2Freog2h_text": "<p>90</p>",
        "ggN44o-k2c8_text": "<p>30</p>",
        "ggQHmftwcS5_text": "<p>OUR PROMISE</p>",
        "ggh53cxCmTQ_text": "<p>Over 700K customers. 4.8/5 average rating. We're confident enough to bet on your experience — because 87% of clinical trial participants felt a noticeable difference.</p>",
        "gghbm0UZ3iP_text": "Feel it, or get your money back.",
        "ggiKIA6MBYH_text": "<p>Monthly Plan</p>",
