        "gg6o8bTo8Ik_label": "<p><span style=\"font-size:px;\"><strong>DOCTOR APPROVED</strong></span></p>",
        "ggDAKO4ejHz_text": "<p>“Started on this about 10 months back, first supplement that I have tried that actually works and you see immediate change in energy levels and sleep and digestion. Much easier to take consistently compared to multiple tablets. Tastes really good for a supplement. I usually add sparkling water and it’s a delicious drink I look forward to every afternoon.”</p>",
