        "ggRgPgSAv2E_text": "<p>“I was reluctant to order this product but I am beyond grateful that I did. Since taking IM8 my overall health has improved and after a year of mixed medical results my last visit, 3 months post IM8, were off the charts. My doctor told me to keep doing whatever I had changed but taking IM8 first thing in the morning had been the only change I had made. It has been a game changer in the gym, my recovery, better energy levels. I now have my wife and sister on the same program. IM8 customer service is top tier.”</p>",
