        "ggk7JdQJCDO_text": "<p>MR</p>",
        "ggmG7pGuqQ9_text": "<p>“For the longest time I wanted to experience the ultimate outcome from supplement usage. I was frustrated using multiple products and often times forgetting to take them. My bloating has significantly decreased. I am also noticing the difference in my skin tone. I had gotten my 81 year old dad a subscription as well and he would like to keep going.”</p>",
        "ggo3UGidzL2_text": "<p>“My level of workouts has improved 10 fold. My energy has increased. Not in an overloaded way. Just steady sailing. Great sleep and I don’t sleep as long. 7 hrs and I’m good to go.”</p>",
        "ggo7ZDg8aZL_text": "<p>MR</p>",
