    "gp_section_609394600167146056": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "accbc4319ddb1f9207674dc1e55293eda2e2d11301be54806c4a99d695be02a1_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg1jOXYxKTl_text": "<p><strong>Daily Ultimate Essentials Pro:</strong></p><p>&nbsp; 1. Scoop out one serving (12 grams)</p><p>&nbsp; 2. Add 8-12 oz (around 230-400 ml) of cold water, juice, smoothie, or your &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; favorite drink (Use less liquid for a stronger taste)</p><p>&nbsp; 3. Shake or blend well then enjoy.</p><p><strong>Daily Ultimate Longevity + Healthy Aging:</strong></p><p>Empty 1 sachet and mix with 8-10 fl. oz. of cold water, juice or your favorite beverage, preferably in the morning with a meal. For optimal longevity benefits, take together with Daily Ultimate Essentials. Drink daily.</p>",
        "gg2NfMD3aFk_text": "The Beckham Stack:<br>Essentials Pro + Longevity Set",
        "gg6ChBR8gu4_text": "<p>Every ingredient and dosage in IM8 is third-party tested. This guarantees that what you see on the label is what you get, so you know exactly what you’re putting into your body.</p>",
        "gg6jyfTArRw_text": "<p>Every ingredient and dosage in IM8 is third-party tested. This guarantees that what you see on the label is what you get, so you know exactly what you’re putting into your body.</p>",
        "gg8O01RKUnx_text": "<p>All 12 hallmarks of aging. Targeted.</p>",
        "gg9l9UsBeLy_text": "<p>TODAY</p>",
        "ggCWOm7IT0J_text": "The Beckham Stack:<br>Essentials Pro + Longevity Set",
        "ggHgPOYE2v3_text": "<p>Third-party tested &amp; certified</p>",
        "ggK-JLr53Vm_text": "<p>Exclusive access to quarterly masterclasses with our world-class Medical and Performance Experts</p>",
        "ggKCSteMZLp_label": "<p><strong>ADD TO CART-$196 USD/MO</strong></p>",
        "ggLMQMT89ii_text": "<p>VALUE</p>",
        "ggP7aQsG47U_label": "<p>One Time Purchase</p>",
        "ggPro2RsUbt_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#50000B;\"><strong>What our IM8 Ambassadors are saying</strong></span></p>",
        "ggQdQoibXzg_text": "<p>PROVEN</p>",
        "ggRptfOT1qN_text": "<p><strong>Daily Ultimate Essentials Pro:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Açaí + Mixed Berries&nbsp;</strong>- Experience a delightful blend with earthy undertones, a subtle tartness, and a hint of chocolate, culminating in a smooth açaí and mixed berries finish.</li><li><strong>Lemon + Orange</strong>&nbsp;- Awaken your senses with a fusion of tangy lemon and sweet orange, delivering a refreshing zest and a sun-kissed aroma, leading to a clean, uplifting finish.</li><li><strong>Mango + Passion Fruit&nbsp;</strong>- Experience a tropical journey with lush mango sweetness, a lively passion fruit kick, and exotic aromatic hints, concluding with a smooth, sun-kissed finish.</li></ul><p><strong>Daily Ultimate Longevity + Healthy Aging:</strong> Experience bright fruity notes, a pleasant pomegranate tartness, and subtle hints of antioxidant-rich berries, culminating in a refreshing and invigorating finish. Use less water for a more concentrated flavor or more for a lighter, refreshing taste.</p>",
        "ggSPIBzlIlA_childItem_0": "<p><span style=\"color:#50000B;\"><strong>Ingredients</strong></span></p>",
        "ggSPIBzlIlA_childItem_1": "<p><span style=\"color:#50000B;\"><strong>Third Party Tested</strong></span></p>",
        "ggSPIBzlIlA_childItem_2": "<p><span style=\"color:#50000B;\"><strong>How to Enjoy</strong></span></p>",
        "ggSPIBzlIlA_childItem_3": "<p><span style=\"color:#50000B;\"><strong>Tasting Notes</strong></span></p>",
        "ggTNDTGpqLf_text": "90-Day IM8 Transformation Program",
        "ggXde5-TvM-_text": "<p>The Beckham Stack is the complete daily ritual David takes every morning. Two clinically-validated formulas in one drink: <strong>Essentials Pro </strong>covers 9 organ systems with 100+ ingredients. <strong>Longevity </strong>targets all 12 hallmarks of aging with NMN 300mg, Spermidine, and Resveratrol. Together, they replace 20+ separate supplements at a fraction of the cost.</p>",
        "ggYcWzttbib_text": "<p>Replaces $502/mo in supplements. Just <span style=\"color:#A40011;\">$5.22</span>/day (quarterly)</p>",
        "ggZqT6eyxXw_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#50000B;\"><strong>What our IM8 Ambassadors are saying</strong></span></p>",
        "ggaE7B4F3bT_text": "<p><strong>90-DAY MEMBERS ONLY</strong></p>",
        "gggmyN7YbyA_text": "<p>95% more energy in clinical trial</p>",
        "ggkhAlg7OTh_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#50000B;font-size:14px;\"><strong>Daily Ultimate Essentials:</strong> Our comprehensive formula combines 90 nutrient-rich ingredients to fuel your body with everything it needs foroptimal health. Packed with essential vitamins, minerals, antioxidants,superfoods, greens, pre-pro-post-biotics and clinical dosages of CoQ10 andMSM.*</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#50000B;font-size:14px;\"><strong>Daily Ultimate Longevity + Healthy Aging:</strong> Designed for cellular longevity, this advanced formula targets all 12 hallmarks of aging with five synergistic complexes. Our NMN NAD+ Energy Booster, Cellular Foundation Builder, Cellular Protection Activator, Metabolic AMPK/SIRT1 Activator, and Cellular Renewal Activator work together to enhance mitochondrial function, promote autophagy, and deliver comprehensive age-defying benefits in one delicious daily drink.*</span></p>",
        "ggnGIE-_Qi6_childItem_0": "<p><span style=\"color:#50000B;\"><strong>Ingredients</strong></span></p>",
        "ggnGIE-_Qi6_childItem_1": "<p><span style=\"color:#50000B;\"><strong>Third Party Tested</strong></span></p>",
        "ggnGIE-_Qi6_childItem_2": "<p><span style=\"color:#50000B;\"><strong>How to Enjoy</strong></span></p>",
        "ggnGIE-_Qi6_childItem_3": "<p><span style=\"color:#50000B;\"><strong>Tasting Notes</strong></span></p>",
        "ggnyfWzEv9I_text": "<p><strong>Daily Ultimate Essentials Pro:</strong></p><p>&nbsp; 1. Scoop out one serving (12 grams)</p><p>&nbsp; 2. Add 8-12 oz (around 230-400 ml) of cold water, juice, smoothie, or your &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; favorite drink (Use less liquid for a stronger taste)</p><p>&nbsp; 3. Shake or blend well then enjoy.</p><p><strong>Daily Ultimate Longevity + Healthy Aging:</strong></p><p>Empty 1 sachet and mix with 8-10 fl. oz. of cold water, juice or your favorite beverage, preferably in the morning with a meal. For optimal longevity benefits, take together with Daily Ultimate Essentials. Drink daily.</p>",
        "ggpTn-YpA2k_text": "<p>100+ ingredients. 9 organ systems.</p>",
        "ggpszzSaXCG_label": "<p>Learn More About the Program</p>",
        "ggqrSbdW33Q_text": "<p><strong>Daily Ultimate Essentials Pro:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Açaí + Mixed Berries&nbsp;</strong>- Experience a delightful blend with earthy undertones, a subtle tartness, and a hint of chocolate, culminating in a smooth açaí and mixed berries finish.</li><li><strong>Lemon + Orange</strong>&nbsp;- Awaken your senses with a fusion of tangy lemon and sweet orange, delivering a refreshing zest and a sun-kissed aroma, leading to a clean, uplifting finish.</li><li><strong>Mango + Passion Fruit&nbsp;</strong>- Experience a tropical journey with lush mango sweetness, a lively passion fruit kick, and exotic aromatic hints, concluding with a smooth, sun-kissed finish.</li></ul><p><strong>Daily Ultimate Longevity + Healthy Aging:</strong> Experience bright fruity notes, a pleasant pomegranate tartness, and subtle hints of antioxidant-rich berries, culminating in a refreshing and invigorating finish. Use less water for a more concentrated flavor or more for a lighter, refreshing taste.</p>",
        "ggr-WPi-RyB_text": "<p>2. Subscribe &amp; Save:</p>",
        "ggrCGWgeyBo_text": "<p>The Beckham Stack is the complete daily ritual David takes every morning. Two clinically-validated formulas in one drink: <strong>Essentials Pro </strong>covers 9 organ systems with 100+ ingredients. <strong>Longevity </strong>targets all 12 hallmarks of aging with NMN 300mg, Spermidine, and Resveratrol. Together, they replace 20+ separate supplements at a fraction of the cost.</p>",
        "ggu9n-jM5h0_text": "<p>TRUSTED</p>",
        "gguX8N9rwz__label": "<p>One Time Purchase</p>",
        "ggxn2FTyKk8_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#50000B;font-size:14px;\"><strong>Daily Ultimate Essentials:</strong> Our comprehensive formula combines 90 nutrient-rich ingredients to fuel your body with everything it needs foroptimal health. Packed with essential vitamins, minerals, antioxidants,superfoods, greens, pre-pro-post-biotics and clinical dosages of CoQ10 andMSM.*</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#50000B;font-size:14px;\"><strong>Daily Ultimate Longevity + Healthy Aging:</strong> Designed for cellular longevity, this advanced formula targets all 12 hallmarks of aging with five synergistic complexes. Our NMN NAD+ Energy Booster, Cellular Foundation Builder, Cellular Protection Activator, Metabolic AMPK/SIRT1 Activator, and Cellular Renewal Activator work together to enhance mitochondrial function, promote autophagy, and deliver comprehensive age-defying benefits in one delicious daily drink.*</span></p>",
        "ggzHy2p6tcx_text": "<p>NSF Certified for Sport</p>",
        "ggzXqAS7QvJ_text": "<p>TOMORROW</p>"
      },
